    "message": "Package DataStandardizer.ISO3166 has been replaced by package DataStandardizer.Geography.  Future fixes and enhancements will be incorporated into DataStandardizer.Geography only.  All users of DataStandardizer.ISO3166 are encouraged to migrate to DataStandardizer.Geography at their earliest convenience.",
